# results/ — generated, not committed

This directory ships empty on purpose. No results are committed to the repository,
so none can drift from the code. Regenerate every numeric output locally with:

    python scripts/run_all.py        # seed = 42

That writes the deterministic outputs
  - cohort_distribution.csv
  - feature_summary.csv
  - diagnostic_performance.json
  - critical_scenario.json
  - explainability.json
  - manifest.json
and the hardware-dependent latency_summary.json.

Do NOT hand-edit or hand-author any file here; all values must come from run_all.py.
